<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>洁家家政 - 北京专业家庭保洁服务</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            background-color: #34495e;
        }

        main {
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-around;
        }

        .service-box {
            width: 300px;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .service-box h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #3498db;
        }

        .service-box p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .service-box button {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            position:relative;
            width: 100%;
            bottom:0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>洁家家政 - 您的安心家政服务伙伴</h1>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">首页</a>
        <a href="services.html">服务项目</a>
        <a href="about.html">关于我们</a>
        <a href="appointment.html">预约服务</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <div class="service-box">
            <h3>日常保洁</h3>
            <p>包含除尘、扫地、拖地、擦拭家具等基础保洁服务。</p>
            <button>查看详情</button>
        </div>

        <div class="service-box">
            <h3>深度清洁</h3>
            <p>包含厨房油污清洁、卫生间消毒、地毯清洗等深度清洁服务。</p>
            <button>查看详情</button>
        </div>

        <div class="service-box">
            <h3>开荒保洁</h3>
            <p>针对新装修或长期未清洁的房屋进行全面清洁。</p>
            <button>查看详情</button>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Copyright © 2024 洁家家政 - 北京地区服务</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
